---
description: Add a workflow from the catalog to this project
argument-hint: <workflow_id>
---

Add workflow `$ARGUMENTS` to this project. First confirm with the user that the workflow exists and dependencies are met — run `/workflow-list` mentally and check `all_deps_met=true` for the requested id.

```bash
curl -s -X POST "{{ backend_base_url }}/api/projects/{{ project.id }}/workflows" \
  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
  -d '{"workflow_id": "<workflow_id>"}'
```

On success, the new workflow's stages are seeded as `pending` StageRun rows. Run `/refresh-context` to regenerate this CLAUDE.md with the new state.
